  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.30.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### 🔧 Other Changes\n* docs: reconcile published v0.29.1 changelog by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2847\n* perf: reuse resolved context optimizer base path by @aryansk in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2587\n* perf: reuse dependency names across policy checks by @aryansk in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2588\n* test(lifecycle): guard shared diamond instruction survival (#2852) by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2858\n* fix(cache): report incomplete cache cleaning (closes #2853) by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2864\n* fix(cache): refresh HTTP cache recency on successful hits by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2859\n* feat(onboarding): make Homebrew core the primary macOS install path by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2846\n* fix(uninstall): retain ownership when package deletion fails by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2860\n* fix(cache): retain recently reused Git checkouts during pruning by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2861\n* fix(cache): reject negative prune ages (closes #2856) by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2862\n* fix(prune): return failure when orphan deletion fails by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2863\n* fix(installer): keep Unix installation unprivileged and owner-aware by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2844\n* fix(cache): report incomplete prune outcomes by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2865\n* fix(installer): verify Unix archive checksums before extraction by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2842\n* fix(bootstrap): recover public release lookup after rejected credentials by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2843\n* fix(tests): restore Windows cache recency CI coverage by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2869\n* fix(ci): run CodeQL on merge-queue commits by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2870\n* chore: release v0.30.0 by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2868\n* fix(hashing): use explicit SHA-2 policy digests and synthetic fixture IDs by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2872\n* fix(tests): prove global uninstall recovery after partial removal by @danielmeppiel in https://github.com/microsoft/apm/pull/2873\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/microsoft/apm/compare/v0.29.1...v0.30.0",
